\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Epoch-Gated Routing Lottery lifecycle. All gate weights are reset to kaiming-uniform at every epoch boundary; Gaussian noise ($\sigma \!=\!0.15$) is applied to all 576 expert tensors to prevent dead-expert inertia. Expert weights are preserved throughout---only the routing map is redrawn. Gradient accumulation ($N\!=\!4$) operates within the training phase.}}{26}{figure.2}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:routing_lottery}{{2}{26}{Epoch-Gated Routing Lottery lifecycle. All gate weights are reset to kaiming-uniform at every epoch boundary; Gaussian noise ($\sigma \!=\!0.15$) is applied to all 576 expert tensors to prevent dead-expert inertia. Expert weights are preserved throughout---only the routing map is redrawn. Gradient accumulation ($N\!=\!4$) operates within the training phase}{figure.2}{}}
